description:
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

- Commit regularly (ask the user where to commit if you're not sure about which branch you should commit to)
- Organize documentation (README.md, LICENSE.md, CITATION.md etc.) in docs/
- If the documentation is folder specific, follow the PROJECT folder structure
- After making code changes, always update the documentation.
- Keep a separate CHANGELOG.md, and avoid mentioning directly about what "changed" in the READMEs. Only document about the current state.